{"id":"8a7089e68dd01fc8","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-completeness.md","title":"Completeness","display":"df-completeness — Completeness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-completeness","aliases":["58-df-completeness","Completeness"],"display":"df-completeness — Completeness","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-completeness</span><span>Completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-completeness — Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c2c52f227661657\" href=\"?note=2c2c52f227661657\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d\\in V\">\\(X,d\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\)</span> (metric-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S\\)</span> (sequence-completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2c2c52f227661657\" href=\"?note=2c2c52f227661657\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completeness} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completeness} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete: Cauchy sequences converge in the space</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> is the standard real-line instance.</li>\n<li>Closed subspaces of complete metric spaces are complete with the inherited metric.</li>\n<li>Banach: complete normed vector space</li>\n<li>Hilbert: complete inner product space</li>\n<li>Baire category: countable intersection of dense open sets is dense in complete metric spaces</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"2c2c52f227661657","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S$ (metric-space predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"2c2c52f227661657","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S$ (sequence-completeness predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completeness} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteMetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})","display":false}],"bytes":1336,"backlinks":[{"id":"d1a6bb52f0ec48eb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-completeness.md|58-df-completeness]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["ce876585d129ce97","2c2c52f227661657"]}